[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0703","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0703.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50570","title":"Fission 权限校验绕过导致宿主机时间损坏漏洞","description":"Fission 在对 Environment 和 Function CRD 进行 PodSpec 安全校验时采用了不完整的 Linux 能力（Capabilities）黑名单机制。该黑名单遗漏了 `CAP_SYS_TIME` 等关键能力，导致拥有创建 CRD 权限的租户可以通过在 `securityContext.capabilities.add` 中请求 `SYS_TIME` 来绕过校验，从而在运行容器中获得该权限。由于 Linux 实时时钟（REALTIME）不具备命名空间隔离，攻击者可调用 `clock_settime` 修改宿主机的系统时间，进而破坏整个节点上所有租户的 TLS 证书有效期、Kubernetes 租约续订及时间序列数据。该漏洞影响 v1.25.0 之前的版本，且在未强制执行严格 Pod 安全准入（PSA）策略的集群中可被利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50570","GHSA-qf5v-m7p4-95rp"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-10T18:17:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:57:43Z","remediation":"立即将 Fission 升级至 v1.25.0 或更高版本。该版本将能力检查机制由黑名单改为白名单（仅允许 NET_BIND_SERVICE），并引入了基于 CEL 的 XValidation 规则以增强 PodSpec 校验。若无法立即升级，建议在 Kubernetes 集群中为 Function-pod 命名空间强制执行 PSA restricted 配置文件，以在 API Server 层面拦截非法能力请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/fission/fission/pull/3465","https://github.com/fission/fission/releases/tag/v1.25.0","https://github.com/fission/fission/security/advisories/GHSA-qf5v-m7p4-95rp","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e75ae6c145bf0fa550455c4b2b7c9e0f03c663af/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50570.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/8aa3fb6edbc01998fa6469125b06f34b431f0aea/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50570.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e701323a68aa022329783fc6fbcb51c8037899bc/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-50570.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e701323a68aa022329783fc6fbcb51c8037899bc/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-50570.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/6d9e48809bb56eb829c7d184fbf6c6fd45cd04df/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-50570.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-50570.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-50570.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/785d709d514558e172acbeb4efdb10760478ab87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-505xx/CVE-2026-50570.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/ede50d3653e824fabe4210e54459047bef709b31/go/github.com/fission/fission/CVE-2026-50570.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/be6cb1a6a44a9623de644275c61d54798195b4f5/content/posts/cve-2026-50570.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0703.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0703.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0703.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0702","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0702.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50569","title":"Fission HTTPTrigger 路径验证绕过漏洞","description":"Fission 在 HTTPTrigger 的验证机制中存在路径验证绕过漏洞。由于 `HTTPTriggerSpec.Validate()` 函数及 API-server 的 CEL 规则均未对 `RelativeURL` 和 `Prefix` 字段进行有效校验，仅在 CLI 层实现了初步检查，导致攻击者可以通过 `kubectl apply` 或直接调用 Kubernetes REST API 绕过所有 URL 级别的安全检查。具备创建 HTTPTrigger 权限的攻击者可配置恶意的路径，例如使用 `..` 进行路径遍历、抢占路由根目录 `/` 或碰撞路由器内部保留路径（如 `/router-healthz`、`/auth/login` 等），从而实现路由劫持或非法访问内部资源。该漏洞影响 v1.25.0 之前的所有版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50569","GHSA-vchh-r53j-8mpw"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-10T18:17:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:57:43Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Fission 升级到 v1.25.0 或更高版本。该版本通过在 API 服务器端引入 CEL 校验规则，强制要求 RelativeURL 和 Prefix 字段必须非空、以 / 开头且不包含 .. 遍历片段，从而修复了 kubectl apply 绕过校验的问题。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/fission/fission/pull/3464","https://github.com/fission/fission/releases/tag/v1.25.0","https://github.com/fission/fission/security/advisories/GHSA-vchh-r53j-8mpw","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2026/CVE-2026-50569.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e75ae6c145bf0fa550455c4b2b7c9e0f03c663af/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50569.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/13b4b6847c146245cb34369c97e37afd6dfad908/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-50569.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-50569.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/6d9e48809bb56eb829c7d184fbf6c6fd45cd04df/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-50569.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-50569.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/42f7ce3fe01d1b8b4a37ed409361811a74eb1f5b/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-505xx/CVE-2026-50569.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/ede50d3653e824fabe4210e54459047bef709b31/go/github.com/fission/fission/CVE-2026-50569.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/be6cb1a6a44a9623de644275c61d54798195b4f5/content/posts/cve-2026-50569.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/9c07393070c4774028819e409c1391a0e8a069cc/api/2026/CVE-2026-50569.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0702.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0701","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0701.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50568","title":"Fission 路径遍历漏洞","description":"Fission 在 v1.25.0 之前的版本中，`pkg/utils/utils.go` 的 `SanitizeFilePath` 函数通过 `strings.HasPrefix` 校验路径是否位于安全目录下，但该方法仅执行词法匹配而未校验路径分隔符边界。攻击者可通过在共享卷中预先创建或控制一个以安全目录名开头的兄弟目录（例如使用 `/packages-extra` 绕过对 `/packages` 的限制），从而实现路径穿越。该漏洞影响 builder 的 Clean 处理器以及 fetcher 的 Fetch 和 Upload 处理器，允许具有相关权限的租户在预期安全目录之外进行读写操作。此问题已在 v1.25.0 版本中通过引入 `os.Root` 强制执行内核级目录限制而修复。","severity":"LOW","score":3.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50568","GHSA-r5jh-q2mw-gcx4"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-10T18:17:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:57:43Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Fission 升级至 v1.25.0 或更高版本。该版本通过引入 `os.Root` 机制替代了存在缺陷的 `SanitizeFilePath` 函数，从内核层面强制执行目录禁锢，彻底解决了路径遍历导致的文件逃逸问题。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/fission/fission/pull/3445","https://github.com/fission/fission/pull/3446","https://github.com/fission/fission/releases/tag/v1.25.0","https://github.com/fission/fission/security/advisories/GHSA-r5jh-q2mw-gcx4","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e7eb023b782298741349c34d7e1f5ea1ecb3d73d/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50568.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/d39b6ea8bd1db5015fd4719557f42ea872f89939/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50568.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/13b4b6847c146245cb34369c97e37afd6dfad908/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-50568.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/13b4b6847c146245cb34369c97e37afd6dfad908/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-50568.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-50568.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-50568.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/42f7ce3fe01d1b8b4a37ed409361811a74eb1f5b/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-505xx/CVE-2026-50568.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/ede50d3653e824fabe4210e54459047bef709b31/go/github.com/fission/fission/CVE-2026-50568.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/be6cb1a6a44a9623de644275c61d54798195b4f5/content/posts/cve-2026-50568.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7330b0580e3b5cfcde14ca2a28aa1774cbe1d7d1/2026/CVE-2026-50568.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0701.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0700","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0700.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50567","title":"Fission 路径遍历漏洞","description":"Fission 在 pkg/utils/zip.go 的 Unarchive 函数中存在 Zip Slip 路径遍历漏洞。该漏洞原理在于程序在解压 ZIP 存档时，直接使用 filepath.Join 将条目名称与目标目录拼接，而未验证解析后的路径是否仍处于预期的目标目录之内。攻击者可以通过控制 Package.Spec.Source.URL 或 Deployment.URL 提供的恶意 ZIP 压缩包，在其中构造包含 \"../\" 路径遍历字符的条目，诱导 fission-fetcher 边车进程将文件写入到其权限可触达的任意位置，包括其他租户的目录、挂载的 Secret/Config 卷以及 fetcher 自身的二进制文件，从而导致敏感信息泄露或远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 v1.25.0 之前的所有版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50567","GHSA-q6vm-xqc9-v3ff"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-10T18:17:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:57:43Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Fission 升级到 v1.25.0 或更高版本。该版本通过在 Unarchive 函数中使用 os.Root 强制将文件写入限制在目标目录内，并增加了对绝对路径、父级目录遍历（..）以及符号链接条目的校验与拦截。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/fission/fission/pull/3444","https://github.com/fission/fission/releases/tag/v1.25.0","https://github.com/fission/fission/security/advisories/GHSA-q6vm-xqc9-v3ff","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e7eb023b782298741349c34d7e1f5ea1ecb3d73d/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50567.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/d39b6ea8bd1db5015fd4719557f42ea872f89939/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50567.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/12510680d47d531059ad635931375e3cc99ef556/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-50567.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/12510680d47d531059ad635931375e3cc99ef556/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-50567.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-50567.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-50567.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/42f7ce3fe01d1b8b4a37ed409361811a74eb1f5b/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-505xx/CVE-2026-50567.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/ede50d3653e824fabe4210e54459047bef709b31/go/github.com/fission/fission/CVE-2026-50567.yml","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/f7c7e24781311f0ffdff9c48a833d9f9836f1760/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-50567/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/be6cb1a6a44a9623de644275c61d54798195b4f5/content/posts/cve-2026-50567.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0700.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0066","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0066.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-20253","title":"Splunk Enterprise PostgreSQL sidecar 服务端点未授权访问漏洞","description":"Splunk Enterprise 的 PostgreSQL sidecar 服务端点存在缺少认证漏洞（CWE-306），未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过主 Splunk Web 应用（端口 8000）的代理路由，直接访问并调用 PostgreSQL sidecar 服务的备份/恢复接口。攻击者利用 /backup 端点将恶意 PostgreSQL 数据库的 pg_dump 内容写入目标文件系统，再通过 /restore 端点加载该 dump 并在恢复过程中触发包含 lo_export 函数的恶意 SQL，实现任意文件写入。最终可覆盖 Splunk 可执行 Python 脚本（如 ssg_enable_modular_input.py）获得远程代码执行权限。该漏洞影响 Splunk Enterprise 10.2.4 以下及 10.0.7 以下版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重，已出现在 CISA KEV 目录中并在野外被积极利用。Splunk 官方已在安全公告 SVD-2026-0603 中发布修复版本，建议升级至 10.2.4 或 10.0.7 以上版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-20253"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-06-10T18:16:40Z","updated":"2026-06-19T06:17:01Z","remediation":"立即升级 Splunk Enterprise 至 10.2.4 或 10.0.7 及以上版本，该修复已在内核层面为 PostgreSQL sidecar 服务端点添加认证校验。如无法立即升级，可停止并禁用 PostgreSQL sidecar 服务以阻断攻击路径：在 Splunk 安装目录下执行 `./splunk disable app SplunkAppForPostgreSQL` 并重启实例。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://advisory.splunk.com/advisories/SVD-2026-0603","https://labs.watchtowr.com/why-use-app-level-auth-when-every-database-has-auth-splunk-enterprise-cve-2026-20253-pre-auth-rce/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2026-20253","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2026/CVE-2026-20253.yaml","https://github.com/pssec-io/CVE-2026-20253","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/2026/CVE-2026-20253.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/7f6823bc066973da81d3ae0684f0bccdfe7fa7a4/2026/CVE-2026-20253.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/47b5b37845c422b41f7f77baee4751638de71f26/http/cves/2026/CVE-2026-20253.yaml","https://github.com/The-DevOps-Daily/devops-daily/blob/6e2bbc0a90d267ad0a93082d11c5869a0d48f5f1/content/posts/splunk-postgres-sidecar-rce-cve-2026-20253.md","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/edea45bcf3f5f232d6349d094e3ed87f8aba3ba7/doc/2026-07/Splunk%20Enterprise%20%E9%AB%98%E5%8D%B1%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%20CVE-2026-20253%EF%BC%88CVSS%209.8%EF%BC%89.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/CVE/blob/4e96ec5c1f919e7ddf89ce2335ced09b058e2b49/2026.06/CVE-2026-20253%EF%BC%9ASplunk%20Enterprise%20%E6%9C%AA%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cb31df1745cb795b327f3818ad29a4b3cf1cd125/cves/2026/20xxx/CVE-2026-20253.json","https://github.com/watchtowrlabs/watchTowr-vs-Splunk-CVE-2026-20253/blob/9f47b6611071322620a7c24334f363297094dbdc/watchTowr-vs-Splunk-CVE-2026-20253.py","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2026-20253_1.yaml","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2026-20253.txt","https://github.com/watchtowrlabs/watchTowr-vs-Splunk-CVE-2026-20253","https://github.com/0xBlackash/CVE-2026-20253","https://github.com/HORKimhab/CVE-2026-20253","https://github.com/Het-Kalariya/CVE-2026-20253","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-20253"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0066.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0750","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0750.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-41695","title":"VMware Spring Data Commons 属性路径缓存拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Spring Data Commons 的 MappingContext 属性路径解析存在无边界资源耗尽漏洞。PersistentPropertyPathFactory.propertyPaths 是一个 ConcurrentHashMap，键由外部用户输入的点分路径字符串（如 HTTP sort 投影参数）派生，每个不同的 path 字符串—包括无法解析的无效字符串—都会通过 computeIfAbsent 永久缓存，缓存中不存在驱逐机制，也不会对未解析结果（PathResolution.unresolved）进行限制。远程攻击者通过反复向 Spring Data REST 端点发送形如 ?sort=<随机字符串> 的请求，每次请求虽快速失败抛出 InvalidPersistentPropertyPath，但每次独特的随机字符串都会在堆中留下一个 TypeAndPath 键及其 PathResolution 对象，包含路径分段列表和原始字符串。无速率限制或路径字符串校验的前提下，攻击者仅需约 1000 万次请求即可耗尽 JVM 堆内存，导致服务 OutOfMemoryError 拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Spring Data Commons 4.0.0 至 4.0.5、3.5.0 至 3.5.11、3.4.0 至 3.4.14 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5 属于高危等级。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-41695","GHSA-88fw-v6x4-3f58"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-10T00:16:50Z","updated":"2026-07-23T09:10:00Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 Spring Data Commons 4.0.x ≥ 4.0.6 或 3.5.x ≥ 3.5.12 或 3.4.x ≥ 3.4.15（随 Spring Boot 3.5.x / 3.4.x 与 3.3.x 补丁一同发布）。若暂无法升级，可在网关/WAF 层对 ?sort= 参数长度与字符集实施硬限（单参数 ≤ 128 字符，仅允许 [a-zA-Z0-9._- ]），并配置速率限制（单 IP 每秒 ≤ 100 个 sort 参数请求），同时在防火墙层面封禁重复大基随机字符串访问以缓解 OOM 风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://spring.io/security/cve-2026-41695","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a8a162b0898524b5cf79dbbcc4c17a9c8ca1960a/cves/2026/41xxx/CVE-2026-41695.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/09b6c4ca09610df5602aea129f04ccdd03d08c21/2026/41xxx/CVE-2026-41695.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/43b3566a7a8a36e5b72f371cb23799b1115f7f78/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-41695.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/43b3566a7a8a36e5b72f371cb23799b1115f7f78/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-41695.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-41695.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-41695.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/99a2d0f359c44d8b27ea5e35eaa72ec2eb0f3016/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-416xx/CVE-2026-41695.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c22f4d895bb96cc596a627af8280a63e96ae16cd/2026/CVE-2026-41695.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/28898b08fefc5076d45a396e18d08a247e21376a/content/posts/cve-2026-41695.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/fd9cadff39b120393c2c764effdf6aaef24df325/api/2026/CVE-2026-41695.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0750.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1136","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1136.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-48292","title":"Adobe USD-Fileformat-plugins 基于堆的缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Format Plugins 1.1.2 及更早版本存在基于堆的缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-122），攻击者可构造特制恶意文件，诱使目标用户打开该文件后触发溢出，在当前用户上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞影响使用 Format Plugins 解析文件的系统，攻击者需在目标主机上具备本地访问权限并诱导用户打开恶意文件。由于溢出发生在堆内存区域且成功利用后可达完全权限，CVSS v3.1 评分为 7.8（高危），影响保密性、完整性与可用性。ZDI 编号为 ZDI-26-351，厂商应尽快修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-48292"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-06-09T21:17:25Z","updated":"2026-07-23T09:10:00Z","remediation":"请立即将 Adobe Format Plugins 升级至 1.1.3 或更高版本，以修复 usdGltf 插件中基于堆的缓冲区溢出漏洞（CVE-2026-48292）。升级方法：打开 Adobe 桌面应用程序或 Creative Cloud，进入\"更新\"页面检查并安装 Format Plugins 最新版本；或前往 https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/formatplugins/apsb26-65.html 下载补丁手动安装。临时缓解措施：避免打开来源不明的 USD 或 glTF 格式文件，禁用系统中不必要的 USD 文件关联程序，直至完成升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/formatplugins/apsb26-65.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/74dc69e33a88e8337ec5752efbf3c7f9ff972c4b/cves/2026/48xxx/CVE-2026-48292.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/afe20f4bdb52ae870e113add0571518dc2153513/2026/48xxx/CVE-2026-48292.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/46a996f0289605434908b7f2bee2aa87049865d7/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-48292.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/46a996f0289605434908b7f2bee2aa87049865d7/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-48292.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-48292.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2026-48292.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-482xx/CVE-2026-48292.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2e01b8ab6dee830118caf8c9609e7908ef49eeb7/2026/CVE-2026-48292.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/95dfeac19c1312c71635dbff08ef6b821c8309c0/content/posts/cve-2026-48292.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/514c5de1bed57e2dcb3d56992a549e0097d9794f/api/2026/CVE-2026-48292.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1136.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1133","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1133.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-48291","title":"Adobe Format Plugins 基于堆的缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Format Plugins 1.1.2 及更早版本存在基于堆的缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-122）。当用户打开特制恶意文件时，格式插件在处理文件格式解析过程中触发堆内存越界写入，攻击者可在当前用户上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本格式插件的系统，CVSS v3.1 评分为 7.8（高危），攻击向量为本地访问，利用需用户交互（受害者必须打开恶意文件）。成功利用可能导致敏感信息泄露、系统被完全控制等严重后果。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-48291"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-06-09T21:17:25Z","updated":"2026-07-23T09:10:00Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Adobe Format Plugins 升级到 1.1.3 或更高版本，可访问 https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/formatplugins/apsb26-65.html 获取补丁。如无法立即升级，应避免打开来源不明的恶意文件，并禁用相关格式插件的自动预览功能以降低被攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/formatplugins/apsb26-65.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9180d6f38159151a7725b3a82799fa2950c45f22/cves/2026/48xxx/CVE-2026-48291.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/afe20f4bdb52ae870e113add0571518dc2153513/2026/48xxx/CVE-2026-48291.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-48291.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-48291.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-48291.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2026-48291.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-482xx/CVE-2026-48291.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2e01b8ab6dee830118caf8c9609e7908ef49eeb7/2026/CVE-2026-48291.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/95dfeac19c1312c71635dbff08ef6b821c8309c0/content/posts/cve-2026-48291.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/514c5de1bed57e2dcb3d56992a549e0097d9794f/api/2026/CVE-2026-48291.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1133.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1128","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1128.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-47924","title":"Adobe Acrobat Reader 释放后使用信息泄露漏洞","description":"标签之间。<value>Adobe Acrobat Reader 存在释放后使用（Use After Free）漏洞，该漏洞可导致敏感内存信息泄露。受影响版本包括 24.001.30365、26.001.21651 及更早版本。攻击者需构造恶意 PDF 文件，并诱骗用户使用受影响版本的 Acrobat Reader 打开该文件才能触发漏洞。成功利用后，攻击者可读取敏感内存数据，造成信息泄露。该漏洞需用户交互方可利用，危害等级为中危，CVSS v3.1 评分为 5.5。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-47924"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-06-09T21:17:22Z","updated":"2026-07-23T09:10:00Z","remediation":"立即将 Adobe Acrobat Reader 升级至 24.001.30383 或 26.001.21662 及更高版本，可通过 Adobe 菜单\"帮助→检查更新\"或访问 Adobe 官网下载安全补丁。如暂时无法升级，建议不要打开来历不明的 PDF 文件，并配置邮件网关和浏览器插件阻止自动下载 PDF 附件，以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/acrobat/apsb26-63.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9180d6f38159151a7725b3a82799fa2950c45f22/cves/2026/47xxx/CVE-2026-47924.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/afe20f4bdb52ae870e113add0571518dc2153513/2026/47xxx/CVE-2026-47924.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-47924.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-47924.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-47924.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2026-47924.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-479xx/CVE-2026-47924.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/95dfeac19c1312c71635dbff08ef6b821c8309c0/content/posts/cve-2026-47924.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1b4388551935a161c058c6e5c833599d33c7e097/2026/CVE-2026-47924.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8ad35b62b45404de8f2963cc958f5644815c9afa/content/CVE-2026-47924.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1128.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1125","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1125.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-47923","title":"Adobe Acrobat Reader 越界读取信息泄露漏洞","description":"Adobe Acrobat Reader 存在越界读取漏洞（CWE-125），受影响版本包括 24.001.30365、26.001.21651 及更早版本。漏洞源于程序在处理恶意构造的 PDF 文件时，未对内存边界进行充分校验，导致攻击者可通过越界读取敏感内存数据，造成信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Windows 系统上安装 Adobe Acrobat Reader 的用户，攻击者需诱骗用户打开特制恶意 PDF 文件方可利用。成功利用后，攻击者可获取内存中的敏感信息，但不会直接影响系统完整性或可用性。此外，Tenable 报告指出同一范围内还存在基于栈的缓冲区溢出漏洞。Adobe 已在后续版本 24.001.30383 和 26.001.21662 中修复该漏洞，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级为中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-47923"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-06-09T21:17:22Z","updated":"2026-07-23T09:10:00Z","remediation":"建议将 Adobe Acrobat Reader DC 升级至 24.001.30383（Classic 版本）或 26.001.21662（连续版本）以修复该越界读取漏洞。可通过 Adobe Acrobat 的「帮助」→「检查更新」功能自动获取补丁，或访问 Adobe 官网手动下载安装。如暂时无法升级，应避免打开来源不明的 PDF 文件，并限制 Acrobat Reader 的访问权限以降低敏感内存泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/acrobat/apsb26-63.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9180d6f38159151a7725b3a82799fa2950c45f22/cves/2026/47xxx/CVE-2026-47923.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/afe20f4bdb52ae870e113add0571518dc2153513/2026/47xxx/CVE-2026-47923.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-47923.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-47923.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-47923.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2026-47923.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-479xx/CVE-2026-47923.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/95dfeac19c1312c71635dbff08ef6b821c8309c0/content/posts/cve-2026-47923.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1b4388551935a161c058c6e5c833599d33c7e097/2026/CVE-2026-47923.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8ad35b62b45404de8f2963cc958f5644815c9afa/content/CVE-2026-47923.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1125.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1123","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1123.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-47919","title":"Adobe Acrobat Reader 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Adobe Acrobat Reader 存在释放后使用（Use After Free）漏洞，攻击者可构造恶意 PDF 文件诱骗用户打开，在文档解析过程中触发对已释放内存对象的引用，从而在当前用户上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 24.001.30365、26.001.21651 及更早版本，成功利用可导致敏感数据泄露或系统被完全控制。利用此漏洞需要用户交互，即受害者必须主动打开攻击者提供的恶意文件。Adobe 已在 24.001.30383 和 26.001.21662 版本中修复该漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-47919"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-06-09T21:17:21Z","updated":"2026-07-23T09:10:00Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Adobe Acrobat Reader 至安全版本：连续发行版（Continuous Track）升级至 26.001.21662 或更高版本，经典发行版（Classic Track）升级至 24.001.30383 或更高版本。升级方式为打开 Acrobat Reader，选择「帮助」→「检查更新」，或通过 Adobe 桌面应用程序管理器下载安装 APSB26-63 安全更新。如暂时无法升级，应避免打开来源不明的 PDF 文件，并在邮件网关和文件服务器中部署 PDF 文件类型过滤策略，以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/acrobat/apsb26-63.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a7bcc119a9ab3b42563555b8edc8c417e3560925/cves/2026/47xxx/CVE-2026-47919.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/afe20f4bdb52ae870e113add0571518dc2153513/2026/47xxx/CVE-2026-47919.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-47919.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-47919.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-47919.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2026-47919.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-479xx/CVE-2026-47919.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/95dfeac19c1312c71635dbff08ef6b821c8309c0/content/posts/cve-2026-47919.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1df391c77d130b035c18b078a1d93cfdac5c26df/2026/CVE-2026-47919.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8ad35b62b45404de8f2963cc958f5644815c9afa/content/CVE-2026-47919.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1123.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1120","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1120.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-47918","title":"Adobe Acrobat Reader 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Adobe Acrobat Reader 存在释放后使用（Use After Free）漏洞，攻击者可构造恶意 PDF 文件诱导用户打开，在解析过程中触发内存访问错误，从而在当前用户权限下执行任意代码。受影响版本包括 24.001.30365、26.001.21651 及更早版本，CVSS 评分为 7.8，危害等级为高。成功利用此漏洞需要用户交互，即受害者必须主动打开攻击者发送的恶意文件。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-47918"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-06-09T21:17:21Z","updated":"2026-07-23T09:10:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 Acrobat Reader 2024 连续版至 24.001.30383 或更高版本、Acrobat Reader 2026 连续版至 26.001.21662 或更高版本，可通过 Acrobat 内\"帮助\"→\"检查更新\"或访问 Adobe 官网手动下载补丁。如暂无法更新，应避免打开来源不明的 PDF 文件，并在操作系统级别启用 DEP（数据执行保护）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/acrobat/apsb26-63.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a7bcc119a9ab3b42563555b8edc8c417e3560925/cves/2026/47xxx/CVE-2026-47918.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5800be5111a4a9084bc37be685bd7d751f884e33/2026/47xxx/CVE-2026-47918.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/82509eeac924c04179aa9efa2ba736077707b551/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-47918.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/82509eeac924c04179aa9efa2ba736077707b551/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-47918.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-47918.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2026-47918.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-479xx/CVE-2026-47918.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/95dfeac19c1312c71635dbff08ef6b821c8309c0/content/posts/cve-2026-47918.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1df391c77d130b035c18b078a1d93cfdac5c26df/2026/CVE-2026-47918.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8ad35b62b45404de8f2963cc958f5644815c9afa/content/CVE-2026-47918.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1120.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1118","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1118.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-47917","title":"Adobe Acrobat Reader 释放后使用远程代码执行漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Adobe Acrobat Reader 存在释放后使用漏洞（CWE-416），由于程序在释放内存后未正确清除指针引用，攻击者可通过构造特制的恶意 PDF 文件诱骗用户打开，从而在当前用户上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Acrobat Reader 24.001.30365、26.001.21651 及更早版本，攻击者需诱骗用户打开恶意文件才能成功利用，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级为高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-47917"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-06-09T21:17:21Z","updated":"2026-07-23T09:10:00Z","remediation":"立即将 Adobe Acrobat Reader 升级至以下修复版本：24.x 分支升级至 24.001.30383 或更高版本，26.x 连续版本升级至 26.001.21662 或更高版本，详细说明参见 Adobe 安全公告 APSB26-63（https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/acrobat/apsb26-63.html）。可通过 Acrobat Reader「帮助」→「检查更新」功能自动完成升级，或前往 Adobe 官网手动下载安装最新版本。如暂时无法完成升级，应提高安全警惕，不打开来源不明的 PDF 文件，同时在邮件网关和终端防护系统层面对 PDF 附件进行病毒扫描，并在浏览器中禁用 PDF 自动打开功能，以降低受攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/acrobat/apsb26-63.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a7bcc119a9ab3b42563555b8edc8c417e3560925/cves/2026/47xxx/CVE-2026-47917.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5800be5111a4a9084bc37be685bd7d751f884e33/2026/47xxx/CVE-2026-47917.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/82509eeac924c04179aa9efa2ba736077707b551/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-47917.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/82509eeac924c04179aa9efa2ba736077707b551/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-47917.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-47917.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2026-47917.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-479xx/CVE-2026-47917.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/95dfeac19c1312c71635dbff08ef6b821c8309c0/content/posts/cve-2026-47917.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/b3f4c2d3415c65726be0117ea27f8235b2a3446a/2026/CVE-2026-47917.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8ad35b62b45404de8f2963cc958f5644815c9afa/content/CVE-2026-47917.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1118.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1115","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1115.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-47915","title":"Adobe Acrobat Reader 释放后使用远程代码执行漏洞","description":"标签之间。<value>Adobe Acrobat Reader 存在释放后使用漏洞（CWE-416），当用户打开特制的恶意 PDF 文件时，程序在已释放的内存区域进行访问，导致任意代码在当前用户上下文中执行。该漏洞影响 Windows 和 macOS 平台上的 Acrobat Reader 24.001.30365、26.001.21651 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.8。攻击者需诱导用户打开恶意文件才能触发利用，成功利用可完全控制受影响系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-47915"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-06-09T21:17:21Z","updated":"2026-07-23T09:10:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 Adobe Acrobat Reader 到 24.001.30383 或 26.001.21662 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可暂时避免打开来源不明的 PDF 文件，并在 Adobe Acrobat 中禁用 JavaScript 执行功能以降低攻击风险。同时建议通过 Adobe 官方更新通道或访问 Adobe 安全公告页面获取补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/acrobat/apsb26-63.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a7bcc119a9ab3b42563555b8edc8c417e3560925/cves/2026/47xxx/CVE-2026-47915.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5800be5111a4a9084bc37be685bd7d751f884e33/2026/47xxx/CVE-2026-47915.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-47915.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-47915.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-47915.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2026-47915.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-479xx/CVE-2026-47915.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/95dfeac19c1312c71635dbff08ef6b821c8309c0/content/posts/cve-2026-47915.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/b3f4c2d3415c65726be0117ea27f8235b2a3446a/2026/CVE-2026-47915.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8ad35b62b45404de8f2963cc958f5644815c9afa/content/CVE-2026-47915.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1115.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1113","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1113.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-47914","title":"Adobe Acrobat Reader 释放后使用代码执行漏洞","description":"Adobe Acrobat Reader 存在释放后使用（Use After Free）漏洞（CWE-416），受影响版本包括 24.001.30365、26.001.21651 及更早版本。当用户在 Windows 或 macOS 系统上打开攻击者精心构造的恶意 PDF 文件时，程序在释放内存后仍继续访问已释放的内存区域，可导致在当前用户上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞利用需要用户手动打开恶意文件，攻击者通常通过钓鱼邮件或社会工程手段诱导受害者打开文件。成功利用后，攻击者可在当前用户权限下执行任意代码，进而窃取敏感数据、安装恶意软件或完全控制受影响系统。Adobe 已在 24.001.30383 和 26.001.21662 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-47914"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-06-09T21:17:21Z","updated":"2026-07-23T09:10:00Z","remediation":"请立即将 Adobe Acrobat Reader 更新至以下安全版本：连续发行版（Continuous Track）升级至 26.001.21662 或更高版本，经典发行版（Classic Track）升级至 24.001.30383 或更高版本。可通过 Acrobat Reader 菜单中的「帮助」→「检查更新」自动获取补丁，或前往 Adobe 官网手动下载安装。如因业务连续性原因无法立即更新，可临时在系统防火墙或邮件网关处拦截 .pdf 附件下载与打开，并启用 Acrobat Reader 的「受保护模式」以及「增强安全」功能，限制 JavaScript 执行与外部内容访问，以降低任意代码执行风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/acrobat/apsb26-63.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a7bcc119a9ab3b42563555b8edc8c417e3560925/cves/2026/47xxx/CVE-2026-47914.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5800be5111a4a9084bc37be685bd7d751f884e33/2026/47xxx/CVE-2026-47914.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-47914.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-47914.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-47914.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2026-47914.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-479xx/CVE-2026-47914.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/95dfeac19c1312c71635dbff08ef6b821c8309c0/content/posts/cve-2026-47914.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1a293285bf198645eacfa1fb6bdd6757780626e5/2026/CVE-2026-47914.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8ad35b62b45404de8f2963cc958f5644815c9afa/content/CVE-2026-47914.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1113.toml"}]